{"version":1,"content":"<p>根據近期曝光的機模照片及業內分析，下一代iPhone Air 2可能仍將沿用初代機型的靈動島設計，而不會像iPhone 18 Pro那樣採用尺寸更小的靈動島。儘管該機型預計將新增一顆後置超廣角鏡頭，但機身內部空間可能不足以支持更小的前置攝像頭開孔佈局。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587670.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:34:53.818970+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:25:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_hash":"37caa79431b41944c91fa47775ef8b30e0ce3ce5538a2d3645319cc2bc6fc6fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}